---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---
<DocsLayout title="Self-host EcliPanel">
  <h1>Self-host EcliPanel</h1>
  <p>Production-first setup for backend, frontend, database, Redis, and optional services.</p>

  <h2>1. Required services</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>MariaDB/MySQL/PostgreSQL (MariaDB recommended)</li>
    <li>Redis</li>
    <li>Bun runtime (backend + frontend build commands)</li>
    <li>At least one Wings node</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. Install panel</h2>
  <pre><code>cd /opt
 git clone https://github.com/heyitslumi/EcliPanel.git
 cd /opt/EcliPanel/backend
 bun install
 cp .env.example .env
 bun run gen:jwt-secret
 bun run gen:pq-jwt-seed
 bun run gen:default-role

 cd /opt/EcliPanel/frontend
 bun install
 cp .env.example .env</code></pre>

  <h2>3. Minimum backend config</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><code>DB_TYPE</code>, <code>DB_HOST</code>, <code>DB_PORT</code>, <code>DB_USER</code>, <code>DB_PASS</code>, <code>DB_NAME</code></li>
    <li><code>REDIS_URL</code></li>
    <li><code>JWT_SECRET</code>, <code>PQ_JWT_SEED</code>, <code>NODE_ENCRYPTION_KEY</code>, <code>NODE_PQ_ENCRYPTION_SEED</code></li>
    <li><code>FRONTEND_URL</code>, <code>PANEL_URL</code>, <code>BACKEND_URL</code>, <code>ORIGIN</code>, <code>RP_ID</code></li>
    <li><code>SMTP_HOST</code>, <code>SMTP_PORT</code>, <code>SMTP_USER</code>, <code>SMTP_PASS</code>, <code>MAIL_FROM</code></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Minimum frontend config</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><code>BACKEND_URL</code> (SSR and server-side fetches)</li>
    <li><code>NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE</code> (browser API base)</li>
    <li><code>NEXT_PUBLIC_WINGS_BASE</code> (optional direct Wings base)</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>5. Start services</h2>
  <pre><code># backend
cd /opt/EcliPanel/backend
bun run dev

# frontend
cd /opt/EcliPanel/frontend
./dev.sh --port 3000</code></pre>

  <h2>6. Production checks</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><code>/health</code> returns OK</li>
    <li>OpenAPI is available</li>
    <li>DB + Redis connect without boot errors</li>
    <li>At least one Wings node appears online</li>
  </ul>
</DocsLayout>
